sequenceDiagram
    participant CRON as the hourly clock (scheduler)
    participant nmf_monetization as nMF, the money engine
    actor PriceProject as PriceProject
    actor Seller as the seller
    participant portfoliovalue as portfolio value
    participant invoicearchive as invoicearchive
    Note over CRON,invoicearchive: Rebuild the price list
    CRON->>nmf_monetization: fires the hourly refresh
    nmf_monetization->>PriceProject: to resolve the template prices [POST /pricing/resolve]
    nmf_monetization->>nmf_monetization: writes the pricing
    nmf_monetization-)nmf_monetization: notifies "pricing.PricesChanged"
    Note over CRON,invoicearchive: Seller reads their portfolio value
    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over CRON,invoicearchive: 1: when Seller opens the portfolio page
    Seller->>portfoliovalue: opens the portfolio page
    portfoliovalue->>nmf_monetization: for the price list [getPrices]
    nmf_monetization-->>portfoliovalue: returns the price list
    portfoliovalue->>portfoliovalue: computes the value
    invoicearchive->>invoicearchive: files the snapshot
    end
    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over CRON,invoicearchive: 2: when portfoliovalue listens "pricing.PricesChanged"
    nmf_monetization-)portfoliovalue: pricing.PricesChanged
    portfoliovalue->>portfoliovalue: recomputes every portfolio
    end
